From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:57:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Google reviews: sync, replies and website review widgets

- Connect Google Business Profile with OAuth (business.manage, offline);
  the refresh token is encrypted and never readable through the API.
- Choose the business location (only ones the Google account manages);
  its review link becomes the Google review site automatically.
- Reviews sync every hour (new, edited, and owner replies), plus "Sync now".
  Imported history no longer floods tasks or automations.
- Post replies publicly on Google from the Reputation page.
- Embeddable review widgets (cards, list or badge; light or dark) that
  always show the true overall rating and say when they are filtered.
  Only /w/* pages may be framed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
